WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.800
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:18.070 --> 00:19.870
On the morning of the explosion,

3
00:19.920 --> 00:22.260
I saw Qi Mo outside the valve pit.

4
00:22.710 --> 00:24.600
But he seemed completely different

5
00:24.600 --> 00:26.280
from his usual self that day.

6
00:26.640 --> 00:28.050
Designers don't usually

7
00:28.350 --> 00:30.060
go to emergency repair sites.

8
00:30.390 --> 00:31.230
I'm not sure

9
00:31.350 --> 00:32.670
whether Qi Mo had anything to do

10
00:32.670 --> 00:33.800
with the explosion.

11
00:37.840 --> 00:39.970
Just as things seemed to be looking up,

12
00:43.560 --> 00:44.670
I was pulled back

13
00:44.670 --> 00:46.520
into the abyss of the truth.

14
01:20.560 --> 01:21.440
Qi Mo!

15
01:22.070 --> 01:23.310
Qi Mo.

16
01:26.660 --> 01:28.090
Is it really you?

17
02:55.520 --> 03:00.370
[Light the Dark]

18
03:01.270 --> 03:03.940
[Episode 8]

19
03:15.590 --> 03:16.280
Xiaoyun.

20
03:17.890 --> 03:18.700
Xiaoyun.

21
03:21.310 --> 03:22.680
You've been lying all day.

22
03:22.680 --> 03:24.079
Get up and eat something.

23
03:26.360 --> 03:27.660
I made all your favorites.

24
03:27.660 --> 03:28.660
Come on, get up.

25
03:30.630 --> 03:32.320
Just try a bite, okay?

26
03:32.430 --> 03:33.829
Come on, come on, come on.

27
03:35.430 --> 03:36.630
Easy, easy, easy.

28
03:46.680 --> 03:47.480
What's wrong?

29
03:50.870 --> 03:51.680
What's wrong?

30
03:52.280 --> 03:53.430
What's wrong, Xiaoyun?

31
03:53.430 --> 03:54.240
Xiaoyun.

32
03:54.260 --> 03:55.860
What's wrong? What's wrong?

33
03:57.520 --> 03:58.780
Are you okay, Xiaoyun?

34
03:59.960 --> 04:00.980
Qi Mo.

35
04:01.400 --> 04:02.290
Qi Mo.

36
04:03.560 --> 04:04.700
What's going on?

37
04:04.960 --> 04:06.420
Why is there so much blood?

38
04:07.670 --> 04:08.460
Call an ambulance.

39
04:08.460 --> 04:09.080
Okay, okay, okay.

40
04:09.080 --> 04:10.610
-Call an ambulance. -Okay.

41
04:14.150 --> 04:16.290
Hello, is this the ambulance service?

42
04:16.430 --> 04:18.029
I have a pregnant woman here.

43
04:18.269 --> 04:19.660
She's bleeding a lot.

44
04:20.170 --> 04:21.180
Yes.

45
04:22.560 --> 04:25.170
It's 730 Huagong Road,

46
04:25.310 --> 04:26.260
Room 203.

47
04:26.310 --> 04:27.580
Hurry up, hurry up.

48
04:27.630 --> 04:28.310
Yes, yes, yes.

49
04:28.310 --> 04:29.720
Xiaoyun, are you okay? Xiaoyun.

50
04:29.720 --> 04:30.620
Xiaoyun.

51
04:40.310 --> 04:41.990
I know you've been helping me.

52
04:44.430 --> 04:46.490
Are you still going to kill yourself?

53
04:47.070 --> 04:48.360
Do you really think

54
04:50.000 --> 04:51.200
I want to kill myself?

55
04:51.630 --> 04:53.450
This is the only way

56
04:54.560 --> 04:56.270
I can see Ying.

57
05:01.070 --> 05:02.300
You're good.

58
05:02.800 --> 05:04.200
You even fooled me.

59
05:11.360 --> 05:12.330
I know

60
05:12.750 --> 05:13.750
you've been investigating

61
05:13.750 --> 05:15.270
whether your parents' death

62
05:15.270 --> 05:16.550
was an accident.

63
05:17.360 --> 05:18.550
I don't know whether your father's death

64
05:18.550 --> 05:19.480
was an accident.

65
05:19.950 --> 05:21.030
But I have my doubts

66
05:21.050 --> 05:22.580
about your mother's death.

67
05:24.270 --> 05:25.570
I've asked Wan Yang.

68
05:26.000 --> 05:27.430
He warned me right then,

69
05:27.480 --> 05:28.520
saying I asked too many questions,

70
05:28.520 --> 05:29.800
and refused to give me any answers.

71
05:29.800 --> 05:30.750
So today,

72
05:30.780 --> 05:31.830
I must tell you,

73
05:32.110 --> 05:32.920
I

74
05:33.720 --> 05:34.980
am definitely not an accomplice

75
05:34.980 --> 05:37.020
in your parents' death.

76
05:42.310 --> 05:43.630
The only thing I'll admit to

77
05:43.630 --> 05:45.310
is being Wan Yang's accomplice.

78
05:45.310 --> 05:47.230
I helped him raise money

79
05:47.270 --> 05:48.800
and collect payments.

80
05:49.680 --> 05:53.000
Now, Wan Yang is dead.

81
05:53.790 --> 05:54.800
My job is gone.

82
05:55.630 --> 05:56.760
And I went to prison.

83
05:57.040 --> 05:57.830
So,

84
05:58.560 --> 05:59.560
I'm not pretending anymore.

85
05:59.560 --> 06:00.960
What's there to pretend?

86
06:01.360 --> 06:02.440
So you want to

87
06:02.720 --> 06:03.890
turn over a new leaf?

88
06:05.050 --> 06:07.040
I don't know if I can.

89
06:07.240 --> 06:09.000
I can't be a bad guy anymore.

90
06:09.390 --> 06:11.050
It just depends on whether God

91
06:11.360 --> 06:12.860
gives me this chance.

92
06:14.720 --> 06:16.430
God is giving you a chance.

93
06:17.560 --> 06:18.890
Teach me how to work out.

94
06:18.950 --> 06:19.520
Isn't this

95
06:19.520 --> 06:20.850
the chance God gave you?

96
06:24.070 --> 06:25.510
Get out of here.

97
06:25.510 --> 06:26.160
I teach you?

98
06:26.160 --> 06:27.420
What chance?

99
06:34.650 --> 06:36.940
[Reform Through Labor, Rebuild Yourself]

100
06:37.480 --> 06:39.710
Over the past few years, our company has successfully

101
06:39.710 --> 06:41.640
overcome its business difficulties

102
06:39.770 --> 06:42.990
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution Co., Ltd.]

103
06:41.680 --> 06:43.659
and stabilized operations

104
06:43.020 --> 06:44.670
[Employee Appreciation Meeting]

105
06:43.750 --> 06:44.920
amid the state-owned enterprise reform.

106
06:44.920 --> 06:45.600
Going forward,

107
06:45.600 --> 06:48.600
we'll continue to expand and strengthen the company.

108
06:49.390 --> 06:51.450
Throughout this challenging

109
06:51.480 --> 06:52.630
reform process,

110
06:52.680 --> 06:54.110
Ms. Peng Xiaoyun

111
06:54.190 --> 06:56.830
has made outstanding contributions to our company,

112
06:56.830 --> 06:59.240
particularly in revamping the financial system

113
06:59.240 --> 07:02.360
and upgrading the information systems.

114
07:09.520 --> 07:11.580
Congratulations, Ms. Peng Xiaoyun.

115
07:11.980 --> 07:15.870
[Certificate of Honor]

116
07:23.110 --> 07:27.120
[Three years later]

117
07:29.480 --> 07:30.720
Right face.

118
07:31.950 --> 07:32.990
At ease.

119
07:33.270 --> 07:34.220
Attention.

120
07:40.020 --> 07:44.860
[Certificate of Release]

121
07:47.900 --> 07:50.420
[Register of Personal Belongings Permitted Upon Release]

122
07:50.450 --> 07:52.200
[I have received all the items listed above and taken them with me upon release.]

123
08:05.070 --> 08:10.640
[Wugang Prison, Jiangnan Province]

124
08:05.950 --> 08:07.720
Brother, you're out.

125
08:07.910 --> 08:09.240
You look thinner.

126
08:09.750 --> 08:10.720
Officer,

127
08:10.750 --> 08:12.560
when will Chen Shan be released?

128
08:14.560 --> 08:15.720
Chen Shan was released early this morning.

129
08:15.720 --> 08:16.780
He's already left.

130
08:17.680 --> 08:18.720
He left at 8:00 AM.

131
08:18.720 --> 08:21.510
He specifically requested an early-morning release.

132
08:21.510 --> 08:22.310
Thank you.

133
08:22.780 --> 08:28.070
[Wugang Prison, Jiangnan Province]

134
08:36.730 --> 08:38.130
Still can't get through?

135
08:39.320 --> 08:40.120
Yes.

136
08:40.510 --> 08:41.200
He...

137
08:41.200 --> 08:42.440
We came all this way

138
08:42.440 --> 08:43.600
for nothing.

139
08:43.600 --> 08:44.360
He should have known

140
08:44.360 --> 08:45.960
we were coming to pick him up.

141
08:48.810 --> 08:50.470
Let's go home and check first.

142
08:53.000 --> 08:53.750
Still can't get through.

143
08:53.750 --> 08:55.150
Still can't get through.

144
09:29.480 --> 09:30.550
Is Shan inside?

145
09:30.550 --> 09:31.680
He hasn't come back.

146
09:34.270 --> 09:34.960
Hello.

147
09:34.960 --> 09:37.030
The number you dialed is powered off.

148
09:37.550 --> 09:38.630
His phone is off.

149
09:41.000 --> 09:42.270
Where else could he go?

150
09:50.440 --> 09:51.660
I've asked people

151
09:51.910 --> 09:53.340
at the county hotels,

152
09:53.550 --> 09:54.880
docks, and bus stations

153
09:55.270 --> 09:56.790
to keep an eye out for Chen Shan

154
09:56.790 --> 10:00.070
and see if they spot him.

155
10:01.530 --> 10:02.730
It's been three days.

156
10:03.720 --> 10:05.150
There's no news at all.

157
10:07.480 --> 10:08.270
Yes.

158
10:10.150 --> 10:11.270
But I don't think

159
10:11.550 --> 10:13.060
you should worry too much.

160
10:13.630 --> 10:15.160
Maybe he just wants to spend

161
10:15.270 --> 10:16.330
some time out there

162
10:16.440 --> 10:19.480
and get used to life outside prison.

163
10:22.550 --> 10:23.360
Look.

164
10:23.360 --> 10:24.850
I told you not to work.

165
10:24.880 --> 10:26.360
That's enough. Leave it, leave it.

166
10:26.360 --> 10:27.240
I'll do the housework.

167
10:27.240 --> 10:27.960
You go out

168
10:27.960 --> 10:29.420
-and have a rest. -It's OK.

169
10:32.150 --> 10:33.490
I... I'll go. I'll go.

170
10:33.670 --> 10:34.750
Just wait here.

171
10:36.480 --> 10:37.360
Who is it?

172
10:42.810 --> 10:43.720
Shan.

173
10:45.260 --> 10:47.190
W-Where have you been?

174
10:47.210 --> 10:48.710
Xiaoyun has been looking for you for days.

175
10:48.710 --> 10:49.710
Where did you go?

176
10:49.730 --> 10:50.570
Come in, come in.

177
10:50.570 --> 10:51.610
Xiaoyun, look.

178
11:11.030 --> 11:11.840
Ying.

179
11:16.510 --> 11:17.480
You've grown up.

180
11:21.120 --> 11:22.120
You look thinner.

181
11:22.910 --> 11:23.720
No.

182
11:26.000 --> 11:26.790
I...

183
11:28.360 --> 11:30.100
bought something for the kid.

184
11:31.750 --> 11:33.480
They must be almost two, right?

185
11:35.200 --> 11:36.000
Shan,

186
11:36.030 --> 11:37.170
come, give it to me.

187
11:38.000 --> 11:39.180
That child...

188
11:40.910 --> 11:42.040
we couldn't keep it.

189
11:42.320 --> 11:43.580
She had a miscarriage.

190
11:45.910 --> 11:46.740
Alright, alright.

191
11:46.740 --> 11:47.670
Today,

192
11:47.750 --> 11:48.840
let's not talk about this.

193
11:48.840 --> 11:49.840
It's good that you're back.

194
11:49.840 --> 11:50.790
It's good that you're back.

195
11:50.790 --> 11:51.480
How about this?

196
11:51.480 --> 11:52.390
Let's not eat at home.

197
11:52.390 --> 11:53.390
Let's go out to eat

198
11:53.390 --> 11:55.400
to welcome you back, okay?

199
11:57.630 --> 11:59.160
No need to go to the trouble.

200
12:00.000 --> 12:01.600
Let's just eat at home today.

201
12:02.630 --> 12:04.000
Okay, we'll eat at home.

202
12:04.000 --> 12:04.320
Okay.

203
12:04.320 --> 12:05.650
I'll cook for you.

204
12:08.480 --> 12:09.080
Shan,

205
12:09.150 --> 12:11.300
let me show you my cooking skills.

206
12:15.630 --> 12:16.570
Come, Shan.

207
12:16.760 --> 12:17.940
Come on, taste it and see

208
12:17.940 --> 12:19.140
if I'm getting rusty.

209
12:19.230 --> 12:20.980
Your favorite tomato and scrambled eggs.

210
12:20.980 --> 12:22.100
Come on.

211
12:23.030 --> 12:23.670
Try it.

212
12:24.670 --> 12:25.890
Are the noodles ready?

213
12:25.890 --> 12:26.550
Yes, yes, yes.

214
12:26.550 --> 12:27.240
Come on.

215
12:27.240 --> 12:28.030
Come on.

216
12:28.120 --> 12:31.340
Come on. Dumplings for departure; noodles for arrival.

217
12:31.370 --> 12:32.320
Taste Mo's cooking.

218
12:32.320 --> 12:33.180
It's very good.

219
12:33.440 --> 12:34.240
Today

220
12:34.240 --> 12:35.360
is a good day

221
12:35.480 --> 12:36.670
for the whole family to be together.

222
12:36.670 --> 12:37.440
Come on.

223
12:37.480 --> 12:38.270
Let's

224
12:38.320 --> 12:39.550
celebrate properly.

225
12:39.550 --> 12:40.240
Come on.

226
12:40.720 --> 12:42.910
Let's toast to Chen Shan's

227
12:43.620 --> 12:44.720
fresh start.

228
12:44.750 --> 12:45.210
Come on.

229
12:45.240 --> 12:45.840
Come on.

230
12:59.480 --> 13:00.270
Mr. Qi.

231
13:01.390 --> 13:03.190
I should call you Manager Qi now.

232
13:04.870 --> 13:06.150
What Manager Qi?

233
13:06.270 --> 13:07.750
You should call me your brother-in-law now.

234
13:07.750 --> 13:09.120
But now you're calling me Mr. Qi or Manager Qi?

235
13:09.120 --> 13:10.030
Look at him.

236
13:10.720 --> 13:11.510
Manager Qi.

237
13:13.030 --> 13:14.550
Ma Yiming told me

238
13:16.070 --> 13:18.870
that on the day of the explosion at the construction site,

239
13:18.870 --> 13:20.670
he saw you outside the valve pit.

240
13:27.390 --> 13:28.850
What were you doing there?

241
13:29.820 --> 13:30.800
Shan.

242
13:31.670 --> 13:33.510
Have you been in prison

243
13:33.510 --> 13:34.700
so long you've lost your mind?

244
13:34.700 --> 13:36.510
What nonsense are you talking about?

245
13:36.510 --> 13:38.270
What were you doing there?

246
13:41.390 --> 13:42.200
Did that explosion

247
13:42.200 --> 13:43.800
have anything to do with you?

248
13:44.030 --> 13:44.930
Did my dad's death

249
13:44.930 --> 13:46.530
have anything to do with you?

250
13:50.030 --> 13:51.830
I've never been to the valve pit.

251
13:52.600 --> 13:53.690
At that time, I was living

252
13:53.690 --> 13:54.890
in Master's office.

253
13:55.550 --> 13:56.790
I was working on my thesis

254
13:56.790 --> 13:57.750
in the office after work.

255
13:57.750 --> 13:58.610
I didn't even

256
13:58.640 --> 13:59.230
go out of the plant gate.

257
13:59.230 --> 14:00.370
How could I have been to the valve pit,

258
14:00.370 --> 14:00.970
Chen Shan?

259
14:00.990 --> 14:03.590
You know best whether you've been there or not.

260
14:03.790 --> 14:05.480
Why did you kill my dad?

261
14:05.750 --> 14:07.810
What was your motive for killing him?

262
14:11.480 --> 14:12.510
Shan.

263
14:14.520 --> 14:16.450
What exactly are you trying to say?

264
14:17.030 --> 14:18.820
You can't just say things like this.

265
14:18.820 --> 14:20.240
Ma Yiming

266
14:20.240 --> 14:22.240
told me this himself before he died.

267
14:22.480 --> 14:23.960
You said you've never been there.

268
14:23.960 --> 14:25.870
You mean he was lying.

269
14:27.030 --> 14:28.540
So I'm the one lying?

270
14:30.120 --> 14:31.100
Chen Shan.

271
14:32.030 --> 14:32.610
I don't care

272
14:32.610 --> 14:33.900
where you've been these past few days.

273
14:33.900 --> 14:34.780
You can't just take

274
14:34.780 --> 14:35.510
someone else's word for it

275
14:35.510 --> 14:36.420
and pin a serious accusation

276
14:36.420 --> 14:37.470
on me.

277
14:37.510 --> 14:38.910
We can't joke about this.

278
14:39.630 --> 14:40.270
Ying,

279
14:40.540 --> 14:41.870
on your wedding day,

280
14:41.870 --> 14:43.250
I was riding my bike with Ma Yiming.

281
14:43.250 --> 14:43.990
I wanted to tell you

282
14:43.990 --> 14:44.820
about this,

283
14:44.820 --> 14:45.780
but we got into an accident,

284
14:45.780 --> 14:46.840
and Ma Yiming died.

285
14:47.660 --> 14:48.820
Later, when I saw you in prison,

286
14:48.820 --> 14:50.490
I still wanted to tell you.

287
14:50.700 --> 14:52.470
But I saw you were pregnant.

288
14:52.470 --> 14:54.070
You were carrying his child.

289
14:56.580 --> 14:57.620
But today,

290
14:57.650 --> 14:58.630
I need an answer.

291
14:59.420 --> 15:00.350
Tell me,

292
15:01.230 --> 15:02.750
why did you kill my dad?

293
15:07.060 --> 15:07.990
Answer me.

294
15:10.420 --> 15:12.020
What am I supposed to answer?

295
15:14.110 --> 15:15.060
Who is Chen Fu?

296
15:17.160 --> 15:18.920
He is my master's husband,

297
15:19.180 --> 15:20.030
your father.

298
15:20.060 --> 15:21.300
I call him dad now!

299
15:24.630 --> 15:25.180
Okay.

300
15:25.990 --> 15:27.150
Let's put others

301
15:27.150 --> 15:27.630
aside.

302
15:27.630 --> 15:29.490
Let's just talk about Mr. Chen Fu.

303
15:29.700 --> 15:31.560
He was the only person at the plant

304
15:32.940 --> 15:35.270
who believed I had talent.

305
15:37.300 --> 15:38.270
Whenever I was mistreated

306
15:38.270 --> 15:38.940
or bullied

307
15:38.940 --> 15:40.270
at the factory,

308
15:40.350 --> 15:41.940
he'd secretly take me out for a drink

309
15:41.940 --> 15:43.270
to cheer me up.

310
15:44.300 --> 15:45.470
How could I harm him?

311
15:46.900 --> 15:48.060
These Chen Fu noodles you're eating?

312
15:48.060 --> 15:49.060
Your dad taught me

313
15:49.080 --> 15:50.460
how to make them!

314
15:52.870 --> 15:53.660
Chen Shan,

315
15:54.470 --> 15:56.180
I think you should know

316
15:58.420 --> 16:01.020
that when something happened to your parents,

317
16:03.230 --> 16:04.190
I put my own future

318
16:04.190 --> 16:05.690
on the line, too.

319
16:07.300 --> 16:08.830
Your parents died,

320
16:09.390 --> 16:11.590
and it hurt me just as much as it hurt you!

321
16:27.160 --> 16:27.970
Shan.

322
16:28.750 --> 16:31.010
I know you've had a hard time these years.

323
16:32.060 --> 16:33.470
We can understand that.

324
16:35.750 --> 16:37.470
But Qi Mo is my husband,

325
16:39.810 --> 16:41.070
your brother-in-law,

326
16:43.270 --> 16:45.000
and the person I trust the most.

327
16:46.420 --> 16:47.600
We'll pretend

328
16:47.620 --> 16:49.580
we didn't hear what you just said.

329
16:51.110 --> 16:51.900
Let's eat.

330
17:04.099 --> 17:04.930
I've already got

331
17:04.930 --> 17:06.060
the answer I wanted.

332
18:15.860 --> 18:16.540
Who is it?

333
18:21.910 --> 18:22.710
Shan.

334
18:22.710 --> 18:23.510
Godfather.

335
18:23.860 --> 18:24.710
Shan.

336
18:25.820 --> 18:27.510
I didn't pick you up that day.

337
18:27.510 --> 18:28.780
I couldn't sleep

338
18:28.780 --> 18:29.710
for several nights.

339
18:29.710 --> 18:31.190
Come in. Come in.

340
18:32.460 --> 18:33.750
Where have you been?

341
18:33.750 --> 18:36.190
Why didn't you call?

342
18:36.230 --> 18:37.580
I just went for a walk

343
18:37.950 --> 18:38.860
by myself.

344
18:43.380 --> 18:44.820
You've burned the food.

345
18:46.900 --> 18:48.060
I forgot about the fish I was stewing.

346
18:48.060 --> 18:48.540
Well...

347
18:48.540 --> 18:49.750
It's okay. Let me do it, Godfather.

348
18:49.750 --> 18:50.510
Don't...

349
19:15.510 --> 19:16.300
Come on.

350
19:17.500 --> 19:18.930
Shan, you really

351
19:19.270 --> 19:21.030
suffered a lot in there.

352
19:23.750 --> 19:25.140
Didn't you used to dislike drinking,

353
19:25.140 --> 19:25.800
Godfather?

354
19:27.510 --> 19:28.950
I'm at this age now.

355
19:28.950 --> 19:31.030
I'm retired.

356
19:31.100 --> 19:32.670
You probably don't know yet.

357
19:32.670 --> 19:34.230
I got laid off.

358
19:34.230 --> 19:36.100
It's all thanks to Ying and Mo.

359
19:36.100 --> 19:38.750
They took pity on me

360
19:39.470 --> 19:41.100
and got me

361
19:41.100 --> 19:42.300
a general manager position

362
19:42.300 --> 19:44.030
at one of the subsidiaries of his company.

363
19:44.030 --> 19:45.060
There are only a few people there,

364
19:45.060 --> 19:46.030
and hardly any work.

365
19:46.030 --> 19:47.580
If I don't drink,

366
19:47.580 --> 19:49.580
life is boring.

367
19:49.580 --> 19:51.580
Only drinking is a bit interesting.

368
19:53.270 --> 19:54.270
I'll drink with you.

369
19:54.270 --> 19:55.860
Come on.

370
19:56.820 --> 19:58.270
Bottoms up.

371
19:58.750 --> 20:00.030
Do you have any plans

372
20:00.030 --> 20:01.620
now that you're back?

373
20:03.860 --> 20:04.710
Not yet.

374
20:05.310 --> 20:06.310
I'll wait and see.

375
20:09.950 --> 20:11.580
D-Don't be so depressed.

376
20:12.230 --> 20:13.030
It's fine.

377
20:13.860 --> 20:14.540
Just take some time

378
20:14.540 --> 20:15.710
to settle back in

379
20:16.230 --> 20:17.820
and get used to the place.

380
20:18.230 --> 20:19.470
As for your job,

381
20:19.470 --> 20:20.670
Ying and Mo

382
20:20.670 --> 20:22.730
will definitely help you sort it out.

383
20:24.230 --> 20:25.560
I don't need their help.

384
20:27.270 --> 20:28.190
And I won't ask them

385
20:28.190 --> 20:28.950
to help me.

386
20:31.950 --> 20:33.030
Shan...

387
20:33.820 --> 20:35.890
listen to my advice.

388
20:36.950 --> 20:37.950
Listen to me.

389
20:38.140 --> 20:39.400
Sometimes,

390
20:39.430 --> 20:41.060
you have to let things go.

391
20:41.800 --> 20:42.720
Godfather,

392
20:43.340 --> 20:45.670
some people might be able to let these things go,

393
20:45.670 --> 20:47.190
but I can't.

394
20:48.430 --> 20:49.750
Ma Yiming was right.

395
20:50.060 --> 20:51.540
He must have something to do

396
20:51.540 --> 20:52.670
with my dad's death.

397
20:53.270 --> 20:54.860
I think about it every minute

398
20:54.860 --> 20:56.140
of every day.

399
20:56.140 --> 20:57.620
Have you asked him yourself?

400
20:57.620 --> 20:58.460
Did you ask him yourself?

401
20:58.460 --> 20:59.520
Does Ying know?

402
21:00.030 --> 21:01.340
I went to Qi Mo's house

403
21:01.340 --> 21:03.140
and confronted him face-to-face.

404
21:03.140 --> 21:04.190
Qi Mo told me

405
21:04.950 --> 21:07.080
he never went to the valve pit that day.

406
21:10.230 --> 21:11.060
Godfather.

407
21:11.470 --> 21:13.100
I don't want to suspect him, either.

408
21:13.100 --> 21:14.780
Qi Mo is my brother-in-law.

409
21:14.820 --> 21:16.100
When my parents had their accident,

410
21:16.100 --> 21:17.470
he helped us so much.

411
21:17.670 --> 21:19.400
Why would I want to suspect him?

412
21:19.470 --> 21:21.540
But he said he never went to the valve pit.

413
21:21.540 --> 21:22.670
What does that mean?

414
21:23.470 --> 21:24.860
That means

415
21:24.860 --> 21:26.030
either he or Ma Yiming

416
21:26.030 --> 21:27.540
must be lying.

417
21:27.910 --> 21:29.100
So who is it?

418
21:29.670 --> 21:30.820
I believe Ma Yiming.

419
21:31.380 --> 21:33.430
He had no reason to lie.

420
21:35.340 --> 21:37.740
So there must be something wrong with Qi Mo.

421
21:42.470 --> 21:43.270
Well,

422
21:46.960 --> 21:48.010
I didn't want

423
21:48.040 --> 21:49.800
to say these things.

424
21:50.060 --> 21:51.110
Look,

425
21:51.470 --> 21:52.600
with Wan Yang

426
21:52.780 --> 21:54.190
dead,

427
21:54.430 --> 21:55.860
who's benefited the most

428
21:55.860 --> 21:56.720
from his death?

429
21:59.910 --> 22:01.060
Go on.

430
22:01.510 --> 22:03.060
After your parents died,

431
22:03.670 --> 22:05.190
Qi Mo

432
22:06.060 --> 22:06.950
was always helping you

433
22:06.950 --> 22:07.750
and Ying,

434
22:07.750 --> 22:08.910
running around taking care of everything.

435
22:08.910 --> 22:09.860
Do you think

436
22:09.890 --> 22:11.230
he was just trying to win Ying over?

437
22:11.230 --> 22:12.510
Or was it because

438
22:12.580 --> 22:14.300
your mother—his Master?

439
22:14.300 --> 22:15.580
Why did he come back

440
22:15.580 --> 22:17.840
with the investigation team right then?

441
22:18.060 --> 22:19.860
I'm not saying he planned it all.

442
22:19.910 --> 22:21.540
At the very least, he knows the whole story.

443
22:21.540 --> 22:22.380
He knows everything.

444
22:22.380 --> 22:24.780
He just wants to become the plant director.

445
22:25.510 --> 22:26.640
Just think about it.

446
22:49.470 --> 22:50.270
Honey, what are you doing?

447
22:50.270 --> 22:51.950
Did you kill my dad?

448
22:52.030 --> 22:52.670
It wasn't me!

449
22:52.670 --> 22:53.510
It wasn't me. It wasn't me.

450
22:53.510 --> 22:54.190
I didn't do it.

451
22:54.190 --> 22:56.120
-Did you kill my dad? -No, I didn't.

452
23:31.270 --> 23:32.060
Xiaoyun.

453
23:34.510 --> 23:36.100
What are you doing sitting here?

454
23:36.100 --> 23:37.500
Why aren't you sleeping?

455
23:39.030 --> 23:39.950
I can't sleep.

456
23:46.510 --> 23:48.110
Are you still thinking about

457
23:48.750 --> 23:50.410
what Shan said during the day?

458
23:54.270 --> 23:55.600
Let me ask you one thing.

459
23:56.860 --> 23:57.950
Do you believe me?

460
24:06.990 --> 24:07.940
Xiaoyun.

461
24:08.190 --> 24:09.470
I thought about

462
24:10.060 --> 24:11.520
what Shan said carefully.

463
24:12.580 --> 24:13.450
Over the years, so many things

464
24:13.450 --> 24:14.980
have happened at the plant.

465
24:15.270 --> 24:16.730
Wan Yang was brought down.

466
24:17.340 --> 24:18.740
An ordinary, dirt-poor,

467
24:18.750 --> 24:20.580
honest man like me ended up as plant director.

468
24:20.580 --> 24:22.380
Many people must be jealous.

469
24:22.380 --> 24:23.270
Then it's easy

470
24:23.620 --> 24:24.690
to see why Ma Yiming

471
24:24.720 --> 24:26.180
said those things to Shan.

472
24:26.190 --> 24:27.990
He was provoked by others to suspect me.

473
24:27.990 --> 24:29.250
I can understand that.

474
24:29.670 --> 24:30.530
But Xiaoyun...

475
24:36.950 --> 24:38.750
You are the closest person to me.

476
24:38.820 --> 24:39.680
Don't you know

477
24:39.710 --> 24:41.040
what kind of person I am?

478
24:44.310 --> 24:45.980
Don't you believe me, either?

479
24:50.470 --> 24:51.870
You're overthinking it.

480
24:53.140 --> 24:54.300
I was just wondering

481
24:56.620 --> 24:58.120
how Shan and I ended up

482
24:58.150 --> 24:59.340
like this.

483
25:05.380 --> 25:07.710
I've been very happy these past few years.

484
25:09.860 --> 25:11.920
Even though you're so busy with work,

485
25:12.510 --> 25:13.860
you never neglect me

486
25:14.300 --> 25:15.620
or this family.

487
25:16.910 --> 25:19.100
You always put me first.

488
25:21.100 --> 25:22.780
How could I not believe you?

489
25:28.240 --> 25:29.600
I'm glad you say that.

490
25:31.030 --> 25:34.100
It doesn't matter if anyone else misunderstands me, then.

491
25:34.100 --> 25:35.360
I work hard

492
25:37.100 --> 25:38.630
just to give you a good life.

493
25:40.270 --> 25:42.600
Thank you for everything you've given me.

494
25:47.990 --> 25:49.100
Thank you

495
25:50.100 --> 25:51.630
for always being by my side.

496
26:27.550 --> 26:32.940
[Wugang New Pipeline Engineering Technology Co., Ltd.]

497
26:47.140 --> 26:47.750
Check.

498
26:55.430 --> 26:56.620
There it is.

499
26:56.620 --> 26:57.540
Go on.

500
26:59.060 --> 26:59.900
How's that?

501
27:00.540 --> 27:01.340
Godfather.

502
27:04.130 --> 27:05.820
Shan, you're here.

503
27:06.620 --> 27:07.430
Alright.

504
27:07.430 --> 27:08.510
Let's stop playing.

505
27:08.510 --> 27:09.270
My godson is here.

506
27:09.270 --> 27:10.100
Okay, okay.

507
27:10.100 --> 27:10.580
Let's play another day.

508
27:10.580 --> 27:11.100
Let's play another day.

509
27:11.100 --> 27:11.910
Okay.

510
27:12.270 --> 27:13.510
I'm pretty good, right?

511
27:13.510 --> 27:15.060
He's from the company next door.

512
27:15.060 --> 27:16.520
It's fine. Come, sit down.

513
27:23.190 --> 27:23.990
You're dead.

514
27:26.190 --> 27:27.740
Dead. That's right, dead.

515
27:28.230 --> 27:29.030
Playing Chinese chess

516
27:29.030 --> 27:30.780
is just like life.

517
27:30.990 --> 27:33.230
You can be alive and still be dead inside.

518
27:33.230 --> 27:34.030
Well,

519
27:34.710 --> 27:37.170
Godfather, you are a veteran of the company,

520
27:37.820 --> 27:38.990
but Qi Mo arranged

521
27:38.990 --> 27:40.120
such a place for you.

522
27:40.380 --> 27:41.950
Well, this is life.

523
27:44.060 --> 27:45.540
After our chat that day,

524
27:46.190 --> 27:46.980
I went back

525
27:47.010 --> 27:48.810
and thought about it carefully.

526
27:49.100 --> 27:50.540
The more I think about it,

527
27:51.670 --> 27:52.380
the more I feel I can't

528
27:52.380 --> 27:53.640
just sit and wait here.

529
27:54.060 --> 27:55.430
So I have an idea

530
27:55.780 --> 27:57.190
to discuss with you.

531
27:57.430 --> 27:58.270
Tell me.

532
27:58.430 --> 27:59.830
Let me join your company,

533
28:00.510 --> 28:01.750
and we'll team up

534
28:02.030 --> 28:03.190
to take down Qi Mo.

535
28:04.710 --> 28:05.750
J-Just the two of us?

536
28:05.750 --> 28:07.030
There are only two people in this company.

537
28:07.030 --> 28:08.060
How can you do it?

538
28:08.270 --> 28:09.340
We don't have the strength

539
28:09.340 --> 28:10.230
to beat him.

540
28:10.230 --> 28:10.950
Godfather.

541
28:11.300 --> 28:12.780
So what if we don't have anyone?

542
28:12.780 --> 28:14.040
We can recruit people.

543
28:14.270 --> 28:14.990
Just get me

544
28:14.990 --> 28:16.190
into the company,

545
28:16.340 --> 28:17.780
and I'll go to Qi Mo

546
28:17.780 --> 28:19.030
and demand resources,

547
28:19.030 --> 28:20.430
projects, and money.

548
28:20.430 --> 28:21.960
There's nothing I can't do.

549
28:23.540 --> 28:25.220
Not bad.

550
28:25.300 --> 28:25.780
Right.

551
28:25.780 --> 28:26.820
I have to let you join the company first.

552
28:26.820 --> 28:27.470
I'll handle this

553
28:27.470 --> 28:28.580
right now.

554
28:29.300 --> 28:30.060
I'll make a call

555
28:30.060 --> 28:31.510
and arrange it.

556
28:42.580 --> 28:43.380
Manager Qi.

557
28:44.750 --> 28:46.030
I have something

558
28:46.030 --> 28:46.950
to report

559
28:46.970 --> 28:48.080
to you.

560
28:48.710 --> 28:49.820
Well, Shan

561
28:49.820 --> 28:51.480
wants to join the subsidiary.

562
28:52.860 --> 28:53.620
No.

563
28:55.620 --> 28:57.060
Are you still angry?

564
28:57.140 --> 28:58.710
Other things might be forgivable,

565
28:58.710 --> 29:00.340
but we can't keep indulging him

566
29:00.340 --> 29:01.470
when it comes to matters

567
29:01.470 --> 29:02.300
of principle.

568
29:03.620 --> 29:04.190
He has no respect

569
29:04.190 --> 29:05.100
for me as his older sister

570
29:05.100 --> 29:06.960
or for you as his brother-in-law.

571
29:07.100 --> 29:08.620
He just got out of prison.

572
29:08.990 --> 29:09.850
Think about it.

573
29:09.990 --> 29:11.340
He spent three years in there.

574
29:11.340 --> 29:13.100
Just think about what he must've been through.

575
29:13.100 --> 29:13.950
Don't worry.

576
29:14.270 --> 29:15.800
No matter what he says to me,

577
29:15.860 --> 29:16.750
I won't take it to heart,

578
29:16.750 --> 29:17.620
okay?

579
29:17.950 --> 29:19.190
That's exactly why

580
29:19.190 --> 29:20.910
we can't let him join the company.

581
29:20.910 --> 29:22.300
He's so unpredictable.

582
29:23.140 --> 29:24.060
Who knows how much trouble

583
29:24.060 --> 29:25.190
he will cause us.

584
29:25.190 --> 29:26.140
Let me ask you.

585
29:26.430 --> 29:27.490
He's out of prison.

586
29:27.670 --> 29:29.470
Doesn't he need to find something to do?

587
29:29.470 --> 29:30.450
Isn't Godfather

588
29:30.470 --> 29:31.990
helping to keep an eye on him?

589
29:31.990 --> 29:33.140
I think

590
29:33.270 --> 29:35.270
joining the subsidiary is the safest.

591
29:35.270 --> 29:37.190
After all, we know him well.

592
29:37.950 --> 29:38.710
He dared to pin

593
29:38.710 --> 29:39.630
such a big thing

594
29:39.660 --> 29:40.910
on you that day.

595
29:43.820 --> 29:45.230
If he really joins the company,

596
29:45.230 --> 29:46.820
who knows what he might do.

597
29:49.100 --> 29:50.840
The company is about to bid,

598
29:51.540 --> 29:53.270
so there can't be any mistakes.

599
29:54.540 --> 29:55.620
You ask him out.

600
29:56.540 --> 29:57.670
I want to talk to him.

601
30:00.950 --> 30:02.540
Okay, I'll try.

602
30:03.620 --> 30:06.080
Turn around. I'll keep giving you a massage.

603
30:41.230 --> 30:42.030
Godfather,

604
30:42.380 --> 30:44.230
why do you keep your head down?

605
30:50.030 --> 30:51.430
I just can't bear to look.

606
30:55.060 --> 30:57.020
Because I was so close

607
30:57.050 --> 30:58.300
to your parents.

608
31:00.190 --> 31:01.190
Whenever I look up

609
31:01.750 --> 31:03.030
and see those two wonderful people

610
31:03.030 --> 31:04.630
frozen in time in this photo,

611
31:05.430 --> 31:06.230
it hurts.

612
31:16.670 --> 31:19.070
I still remember when Dad just passed away.

613
31:20.710 --> 31:21.950
He left so suddenly

614
31:22.380 --> 31:23.620
that we didn't even have a decent photo

615
31:23.620 --> 31:24.430
of him.

616
31:25.340 --> 31:26.750
So we searched

617
31:27.140 --> 31:29.600
and found this photo of Mom and Dad together.

618
31:30.670 --> 31:31.520
We thought

619
31:31.540 --> 31:33.430
we'd cut the photo in half

620
31:34.100 --> 31:35.080
and put Dad's half up

621
31:35.080 --> 31:38.100
as his memorial portraitas.

622
31:41.510 --> 31:42.750
Unexpectedly, not long after,

623
31:42.750 --> 31:43.950
Mom also passed away.

624
31:44.910 --> 31:46.270
Ying and I thought about

625
31:46.950 --> 31:48.600
gluing the two halves

626
31:48.860 --> 31:50.140
back together.

627
31:51.580 --> 31:54.340
Then it was whole again.

628
31:56.030 --> 31:57.230
This way, it was as if

629
31:59.300 --> 32:01.560
Mom and Dad were finally together again.

630
32:01.670 --> 32:02.670
Shan,

631
32:02.860 --> 32:04.390
let's talk about business.

632
32:04.820 --> 32:06.220
Well, there's a problem.

633
32:07.380 --> 32:09.350
Your joining the subsidiary

634
32:09.470 --> 32:11.910
was pretty much a done deal.

635
32:12.430 --> 32:14.320
But when it came to your brother-in-law,

636
32:14.320 --> 32:15.040
he just...

637
32:15.190 --> 32:16.030
disagreed.

638
32:17.680 --> 32:19.130
Qi Mo disagreed?

639
32:19.510 --> 32:21.370
Right, this is going to be tricky.

640
32:25.910 --> 32:27.750
It's fine. The more he disagrees,

641
32:27.750 --> 32:28.710
the more it shows

642
32:28.990 --> 32:30.300
he's guilty

643
32:30.990 --> 32:32.460
and nervous about this.

644
32:35.430 --> 32:36.430
It's fine, Godfather.

645
32:36.430 --> 32:37.960
I'll figure something out.

646
32:39.030 --> 32:39.820
Okay, okay.

647
32:51.860 --> 32:52.580
Shan.

648
32:54.950 --> 32:55.670
Manager Qi.

649
32:59.270 --> 33:00.530
Do you need something?

650
33:01.510 --> 33:03.650
You know, the other day at home,

651
33:03.950 --> 33:05.430
things got pretty unpleasant.

652
33:05.430 --> 33:06.220
Today,

653
33:06.240 --> 33:07.470
I waited here specifically for you.

654
33:07.470 --> 33:08.470
Xiaoyun and I want

655
33:08.950 --> 33:10.000
to treat you

656
33:10.140 --> 33:11.230
to a meal.

657
33:13.430 --> 33:14.270
A trap?

658
33:16.950 --> 33:17.750
Shan.

659
33:17.860 --> 33:19.590
During those 3 years you were in prison,

660
33:19.590 --> 33:21.060
Xiaoyun thought about you

661
33:21.090 --> 33:22.140
all the time.

662
33:22.300 --> 33:23.950
Whether you believe it or not,

663
33:23.950 --> 33:24.950
we

664
33:25.140 --> 33:27.270
have never treated you as an outsider.

665
33:27.270 --> 33:28.800
Whether you admit it or not,

666
33:28.990 --> 33:30.820
I will always be your brother-in-law.

667
33:30.820 --> 33:31.580
This meal

668
33:32.230 --> 33:33.710
doesn't mean anything else.

669
33:33.710 --> 33:35.140
I just want to clear up

670
33:35.230 --> 33:36.710
all the misunderstandings,

671
33:36.710 --> 33:37.430
okay?

672
33:37.580 --> 33:39.340
After all, we are family.

673
33:40.820 --> 33:42.230
I understand what's been

674
33:42.670 --> 33:43.910
eating at you.

675
33:44.100 --> 33:44.710
Well,

676
33:45.430 --> 33:46.580
you believe everything

677
33:46.580 --> 33:48.300
other people tell you.

678
33:48.820 --> 33:50.340
But I've explained

679
33:50.620 --> 33:52.510
everything to you, haven't I?

680
33:52.580 --> 33:53.540
As for the rest,

681
33:54.230 --> 33:55.990
we can only leave it to time.

682
33:57.190 --> 33:58.300
What if

683
33:58.470 --> 33:59.820
I just don't want to go to this meal?

684
33:59.820 --> 34:00.730
Well,

685
34:01.340 --> 34:02.710
why wouldn't you go?

686
34:03.270 --> 34:04.510
Are you afraid of something?

687
34:04.510 --> 34:05.090
I know

688
34:05.120 --> 34:06.910
during those three years in prison,

689
34:06.910 --> 34:08.139
