690
34:08.139 --> 34:08.909
But you

691
34:09.060 --> 34:10.340
have to move on.

692
34:10.370 --> 34:11.699
You have to face your new life.

693
34:11.699 --> 34:12.260
No.

694
34:12.580 --> 34:13.429
Manager Qi,

695
34:14.389 --> 34:16.100
