696
34:16.790 --> 34:18.989
And I shouldn't be the one who's afraid.

697
34:20.659 --> 34:22.170
It's just a meal, right?

698
34:22.540 --> 34:23.469
I'll go with you.

699
34:23.870 --> 34:24.350
Let's go.

700
34:24.350 --> 34:24.949
Let's go.

701
34:53.350 --> 34:54.060
Xiaoyun.

702
34:54.659 --> 34:56.920
You're here. We've been waiting for you.

703
34:57.350 --> 34:58.990
Please serve the food.

704
35:02.390 --> 35:03.730
Here, give it to me.

705
35:06.430 --> 35:08.430
Today, let's not

706
35:08.470 --> 35:09.330
let groundless things

707
35:09.330 --> 35:10.260
