790
38:07.640 --> 38:08.800
You... you two...

791
38:13.140 --> 38:14.930
I'll pay the bill.

792
38:14.990 --> 38:17.350
S-Sorry.

793
38:17.430 --> 38:19.060
Xiaoyun, Xiaoyun.

794
38:41.660 --> 38:42.470
Xiaoyun.

795
38:43.430 --> 38:45.630
I really have to say a word for Chen Shan.

796
38:46.060 --> 38:46.870
You didn't

797
38:47.220 --> 38:48.750
