816
39:17.580 --> 39:19.580
I don't want to fight with you because of him.

817
39:19.580 --> 39:20.910
Anyway, remember this.

818
39:21.220 --> 39:23.020
From now on, he is him, and I am me.

819
39:23.310 --> 39:25.240
Don't bring him up to me ever again.

820
39:28.660 --> 39:29.470
Okay.

821
39:30.140 --> 39:31.230
Calm down first.

822
39:31.250 --> 39:32.250
Calm down.

823
