859
40:43.390 --> 40:43.990
Don't worry.

860
40:43.990 --> 40:45.070
Let me think about it.

861
40:45.070 --> 40:46.270
Let me think about it.

862
40:46.700 --> 40:47.510
That guy,

863
40:48.140 --> 40:48.910
Qi Mo,

864
